flowchart TB
    Tool[VFS / Tool<br/>web_fetch, file_read]:::tool
    Tool -->|抛出异常| Capture[Capture Site<br/>ToolErrorRecovery]:::capture
    Capture -->|判定来源| Tag[TaggedContent<br/>origin = TOOL_OUTPUT_EXTERNAL<br/>sourceRef = web_fetch://evil.com]:::tag

    Tag -->|传入 RecoveryContext| Strategy[Recovery Strategy<br/>ReflectionInjection / TopologyMutation]:::strategy
    Strategy -->|根据 origin 选择模板<br/>EXTERNAL -> untrusted template| Result[RecoveryResult<br/>requiresReauthorization = true<br/>side effect = deferred callback]:::result

    Result -->|被 Orchestrator 拦截| Gate{Reauthorization Gate<br/>RecoveryOrchestrator}:::gate
    Gate -->|requiresReauthorization<br/>== true ?| Check[PermissionChecker<br/>+ RoleSelector<br/>P_new <= P_old ?]:::check

    Check -->|通过<br/>合法降级| Exec[执行延迟副作用<br/>resumeNode newRole]:::pass
    Check -->|拒绝<br/>越权提权| Block[阻断<br/>RecoveryResult.failed]:::block

    Exec --> Final([恢复成功<br/>权限未提升]):::pass
    Block --> Deny([恢复被拒<br/>攻击被阻止]):::block

    Invariant[权限降级不变式<br/>P recovery action <= P failed execution<br/>类比 OS: 异常处理器不得提权]:::note
    Invariant -.->|约束| Check

